{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43239","headline":"再登河阳城怀古 · 朱延","name":"再登河阳城怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客游倦旅思，憩驾陟崇墉。\n元凯标奇迹，安仁擅美踪。\n远近浊河流，出没青山峰。\n伫想空不极，怀古怅无从。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱延","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}